# ── Internal documents ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Business and personal material that happens to live next to the technical
# docs. Kept on disk, deliberately not tracked, so nobody who gets access to
# this repo reads the margins or the honest list of what is still weak.
#
#   PRICING-WORKSHEET  what a shop is worth to you, and why
#   SHIPPING-PLAN      the roadmap, including every known gap and weakness
#   REPORT             an academic submission, personal to the author
#   DEMO-POST          unpublished marketing drafts
#
# NOTE: these were tracked until 13 Aug 2026 and remain in git history.
# Untracking stops them appearing in the current checkout; it does not
# unpublish them. Anyone who can clone this repo can still recover them from
# an older commit. That was an accepted trade-off — scrubbing history means
# rewriting every commit hash and breaking existing clones. Treat anything
# genuinely secret as already disclosed and rotate it instead.
docs/PRICING-WORKSHEET.md
docs/SHIPPING-PLAN.md
docs/REPORT.md
docs/DEMO-POST.md